# {{projectName}} — AI Agent Context

## What this repository is

`{{projectSlug}}` is the **KORAS Control Plane** — the platform provisioning and
entitlement authority for all KORAS SaaS products. Generated from
`koras-saas-starter` using `--profile {{profile}}`.

