## Critical rules

- This is NOT a normal SaaS product. Do not add tenant tables or billing flows.
- Product registration endpoints live here; the Control Plane never registers itself.
- The Control Plane must bootstrap without requiring a pre-existing Control Plane.

## Key commands

```bash
make bootstrap   # first-time setup
make dev         # start local stack
make down        # stop containers
make test        # run all tests
make health      # verify all services
```

## Technology stack

- **Frontend:** Next.js 15, TypeScript 5, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui
- **Backend:** FastAPI, Python 3.12+, SQLAlchemy 2, ARQ
- **Database:** Supabase (PostgreSQL) with RLS
- **Auth:** ZITADEL (KORAS staff identity — MFA enforced)
- **Secrets:** Doppler

