| `stg`       | `staging` |
| `prod`      | `main`    |

## Platform capabilities

- Product registry — register and manage KORAS products
- Organization registry — manage customer organizations
- Tenant registry — manage tenants across products
- Provisioning authority — orchestrate product infrastructure
- Reconciliation engine — drift detection and correction
- Subscription management — plan and billing lifecycle
- Entitlement authority — feature gate decisions
- Infrastructure registry — track all provisioned resources

